# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Go email service — environment variables
#
# Copy karke shuru kar:   cp .env.example .env
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# "development" hone pe main.go godotenv se .env load karta hai.
# Docker/production mein isse khali chhod — env vars seedha inject hote hain.
ENVIRONMENT=development

PORT=8080

# ── Database ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Cron job users collection padhne ke liye use karta hai.
# Compose ise mongodb://mongo:27017/... set karta hai.
#
# NOTE: email-cron.go mein database ka naam abhi `dbName := "test"` HARDCODE hai,
# aur DB_NAME wali line commented hai. Ye is URI ko override kar deta hai.
# Day 3 ke aas-paas theek karna hai.
MONGO_URI=mongodb://localhost:27017/gsacademia?directConnection=true

# Abhi code isse padhta nahi (hardcoded "test" use hota hai). Fix ke baad zinda hoga.
DB_NAME=gsacademia

# ── SMTP ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Gmail ke liye normal password nahi chalega — App Password chahiye
# (Google Account → Security → 2-Step Verification → App passwords).
MAIL_HOST=smtp.gmail.com
MAIL_USER=your-email@gmail.com

# Naam par dhyaan de: Go SMTP_MAIL_PASS padhta hai, MAIL_PASS nahi.
# (Node ke .env mein MAIL_PASS hai — dono alag hain. Aisi cheezein baad mein
#  ek shared config schema mein aani chahiye.)
SMTP_MAIL_PASS=

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# SECURITY — do cheezein abhi khuli hain
#
# 1. services/emailSender.go mein `From` header HARDCODE hai
#    (gsacademia5404@gmail.com), env se nahi aata.
#
# 2. Wahi file `InsecureSkipVerify: true` set karti hai — SMTP ka TLS
#    verification band. Matlab connection MITM ho sakta hai, credentials samet.
#
# Dono Day 1 ki security cleanup list mein hain.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
